# File and folder naming

Full spec: `docs/architecture.md`. Copy `search` / `repo-detail`; do not invent a new layout.

## Folders

- kebab-case only (`repo-detail`). Never PascalCase, snake_case, `utils/`, `helpers/`, or empty folders.
- New features: `src/features/<kebab>/{screens,components,hooks}/` — omit a subfolder if unused.
- Features must not import other features. `shared/` must not import `features/`.

## Files

- Screens: `PascalCase` + `Screen` (`RepoDetailScreen.tsx`).
- Components: `PascalCase` (`RepoRow.tsx`). Styles: sibling `RepoRow.styles.ts`.
- Hooks: `useRepoDetail.ts`. Modules: camelCase (`getRepo.ts`, `queryKeys.ts`).
- Tests: colocated `*.test.ts(x)`. No `__tests__/`, no snapshots, no i18n mocks.

## Placement

- Screen / feature hook / feature-only UI → that feature.
- GitHub HTTP → `src/shared/api/github/` (one endpoint per file, DTOs in `dto.ts`).
- Cross-feature widgets → `src/shared/ui/`. Domain types → `src/shared/types/`.
- Imports: `@/…` across folders; relative only inside the same slice. No new barrel `index.ts`.
